    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ey mon! Today be a big day for ya, I see. Ya think you're ready to take de reins of one of these fierce creatures, huh?\r\n\r\nMost be underestimatin' how intelligent and savage these beasts be. Ya won't be findin' a better, faster or more lethal companion once ya be bonded with it.\r\n\r\nSo, you be havin' an important choice to make. Ya raptor and you will be traversin' the world together, and the raptor will also be needin' to choose ya in return.\r\n\r\nGo an' take a look and return to me when ya made ya choice.",
